    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们将聚焦雷神托尔的传奇经历，看看他如何和巨人国的巨人们斗智斗勇，如何凭借雷神之锤守护神族与人类；还会聊聊诸神黄昏的导火索--光明之神巴德尔的陨落；最后我们会详细拆解那场终极末日战役，看看诸神与巨人、怪物们的终极对决，以及世界在毁灭之后的重生。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 洛基走访矮人国，囊获六件宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 雷神托尔(Thor)征战巨人国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 诸神黄昏的前奏--光明之神巴德尔的陨落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a> 洛基的黑化&amp; 诸神黄昏的末日之战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2893">48:13</a> 北欧神话vs.希腊神话</span></p><span></span><p><span>下图👇本期推荐的原本阅读书目</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmE5pnYz_EdYTjZNYg-ide_QX3uy.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>下图👇北欧九界表格</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBK9mVIOMshK7sqB5M_nnkGPABl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>下图👇北欧诸神中英对照表 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQNvQP724azRV52h822KwtEjHx2.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
